 take a piece of the pork and maybe  dip it in the soup that you want and eat  that and eat some collards and no matter  how much I warn a guest or advise a  guest a lot of people end up taking the  broth and dumping it on top of their  cold noodles which is sort of like it's  you know like eating pizza with a fork  and a knife  [Music]  so it's very exciting time to be in New  York and in America for for Robin  because it's sort of like Japan 15 20  years ago  scammin is something that people weren't  really comfortable with in Japan  initially and now there's shops all over  Japan that only serves gaming so I'm not  surprised that it's a new thing for  Americans but it's really fun way to eat  it's fun way to dip and slurp for me  personally I mean I've eaten you know  tens of thousands of bowls of ramen and  I eat a bowl of ramen I think of nothing  else but the bowl of ramen I don't talk  to anybody I don't eat my salad I like  get into the bowl and I usually slurp  and chew and suck or whatever until the  ball is empty  [Music]

